  m_Name: Regatta Cell Config 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  CellName: Regatta
  Description: Regatta at intensity 1 of 4 (CellTypeChoiceOptions.IntensityWise, list order = intensity): a closed circuit of 8 rings with three super-shielded rails - one per playable domain - braided along it, 1812 (6,6,8) prisms on a 4828u spine, mouths 110u, no corner under 200u. The standard nucleus is the crystal respawn volume and the inner shell; the spawn profile is the Barren cell's (no flora, no fauna - shielded mass is never food, and a race whose obstacles differ per peer is not a race). PhaseThresholds ride the rails' MEASURED volume (Tools/Build/regatta_course_measurements.json) plus a trail band - regenerate with Tools/Build/author_regatta_assets.py, never by hand; the count x 16 derivation is 18x low here because a (6,6,8) prism is 288 volume.
